      "sourceTextSha256": "b74c630d15e9593489e56a6c29a508c613c98020942ffeb01c78ad0bb0670f60",
      "text": "Day 3 · Breakfast and flight to Cusco; reception and transfer to the hotel. In the afternoon, visit the Archaeological Park of Sacsayhuamán in the upper part of Cusco: Tambomachay, a spring-water site believed to have been a place of worship; Q’enqo, a stone labyrinth with a sacrificial altar at its centre; the fortress of Sacsayhuamán, with its massive stones and a wonderful view over Cusco; and the Puka Pukara tower, before returning to the city.",
